(The survey and field observations revealed that lack of basic digital literacy is a major challenge in Village) Tj
T* (Sangrahe Kalan. While most respondents own smartphones and have access to internet services, many are not) Tj
T* (comfortable using digital tools independently. Common issues included difficulty in making online payments,) Tj
T* (accessing government services, using educational platforms, and understanding online safety practices. The) Tj
T* (study also found that many people depend on family members or others for digital tasks. The findings clearly) Tj
T* (indicate that awareness, practical training, and continuous support are required to improve digital literacy and) Tj
T* (promote effective use of technology in the community.) Tj
